B.apA=new A.ba(B.bW,["1. Introduction","Welcome to Lifeline. Lifeline is a technology platform connecting food donors, NGOs, volunteers, and beneficiaries to prevent food waste and alleviate hunger."],t.o)
B.apq=new A.ba(B.bW,["2. User Responsibilities","All users agree to provide accurate registration details, maintain secure password credentials, and adhere to community guidelines at all times."],t.o)
B.apu=new A.ba(B.bW,["3. Food Donation Guidelines","Donors certify that all shared food is freshly prepared, stored in hygienic containers, and completely safe for human consumption."],t.o)
B.apB=new A.ba(B.bW,["4. Community Guidelines","Lifeline maintains zero tolerance for harassment, discrimination, misuse of shared resources, or commercial reselling of donated food."],t.o)
B.apw=new A.ba(B.bW,["5. Delivery Partner Responsibilities","Delivery partners agree to transport meals in clean insulated carriers, maintain real-time GPS telemetry, and deliver prompt assistance."],t.o)
B.aps=new A.ba(B.bW,["6. Platform Limitations","Lifeline acts solely as a technological facilitator and disclaims liability for independent actions of platform users."],t.o)
B.apr=new A.ba(B.bW,["7. Privacy & Data Handling","User personal data, location telemetry, and contact details are processed strictly in accordance with the Lifeline Privacy Policy."],t.o)
B.apo=new A.ba(B.bW,["8. Liability Disclaimer","Lifeline shall not be held liable for damages, food spoilage during transit, or indirect losses arising from platform usage."],t.o)
B.apD=new A.ba(B.bW,["9. Account Suspension Policy","Repeated safety violations, false declarations, or breach of community standards will result in immediate permanent account suspension."],t.o)
B.apt=new A.ba(B.bW,["10. Contact Information","For questions, support, or policy inquiries, contact legal@lifeline.org or visit our support dashboard."],t.o)
